{"id":"8ec065689fdce567","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-single-event-enumeration.md","title":"统一 c.e. 列有可计算单事件时钟","display":"thm-single-event-enumeration — 统一 c.e. 列有可计算单事件时钟","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-single-event-enumeration","aliases":["20-thm-single-event-enumeration"],"display":"thm-single-event-enumeration — 统一 c.e. 列有可计算单事件时钟","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 2.6.1；Convention 2.6.2；Exercise 2.6.6","source_printed_pages":[46,47,48],"source_pdf_pages":[82,83,84],"depends_on":["[[20-df-one-event-clock]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-single-event-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-single-event-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-single-event-enumeration — 统一 c.e. 列有可计算单事件时钟"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.6.1；Convention 2.6.2；Exercise 2.6.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>46</span><span>47</span><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>82</span><span>83</span><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" href=\"?note=a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" title=\"20-df-one-event-clock\">20-df-one-event-clock</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为上游的全函数限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" href=\"?note=a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" title=\"20-df-one-event-clock\">20-df-one-event-clock</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}single\\text{-}event\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\operatorname{Clock}(a,V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}single\\text{-}event\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\operatorname{Clock}(a,V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用统一索引函数并行模拟各列，在阶段 s 收集 e,x&lt;s 范围内已发现、尚未输出的事件。每次输出配对代码最小的一个，或空步。给定事件之下只有有限个代码，故它被发现后终会输出；同一事件只记一次。重放前 s 阶段便能有效产生每列完整代码。必要时把新输出推迟一阶段，满足坐标严格小于时钟值。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.6.1；Convention 2.6.2；Exercise 2.6.6；印刷页 46, 47, 48；PDF 第 82, 83, 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-one-event-clock","status":"resolved","id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-event-clock]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-event-clock","status":"resolved","id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","